---
const accent = "#9f303a";
---

<section id="top" class="w-full border-black">
  <div class="grid min-h-[calc(100vh-73px)] grid-rows-[1fr_auto]">
    <div
      class="relative flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24"
    >
      <!-- Líneas diagonales -->
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <span
          class="absolute -top-[10%] right-[7%] h-[120%] w-[30px] rotate-[28deg] bg-primary opacity-100"
        ></span>
        <span
          class="absolute -top-[10%] right-[13%] h-[120%] w-[30px] rotate-[28deg] bg-primary opacity-100"
        ></span>
      </div>
      <p
        class="relative z-10 mb-8 max-w-xl font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase leading-relaxed md:text-sm"
      >
        [ SISTEMA ACTIVO <span class="text-primary">//</span> INGENIERÍA DE SOFTWARE
        ]
      </p>
      <h1
        class="relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] text-[14vw] font-black uppercase leading-[0.78] tracking-[-0.09em] sm:text-[11vw] md:text-[10.5vw]"
      >
        Software<br /><span style={{ color: accent }}>Inquebrantable</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="relative z-10 mt-8 max-w-2xl font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase leading-relaxed md:text-sm"
      >
        Forjamos infraestructura pesada para sistemas críticos. APIs
        resilientes, servicios y aplicaciones web blindadas para transformar tu
        negocio con herramientas a tu medida. Cero código frágil. Cero deuda
        técnica.
      </p>
      <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="#work"
          class="border-2 border-black bg-black px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase text-surface hover:bg-primary hover:text-black"
          >VER CÓDIGO & PROYECTOS ↗</a
        >
        <a
          href="#contact"
          class="border-2 border-black px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase bg-surface hover:bg-primary"
          >DESPLEGAR PROYECTO ↗</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid border-t-4 border-black font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase sm:grid-cols-2"
    >
      <div class="border-b-2 border-black p-4 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r-2">
        [ NÚCLEO ESTABLE // LATENCIA CERO ]
      </div>
      <div class="p-4">BAJAR PARA INSPECCIONAR</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
